&lt;div class=&quot;job-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;U.S. Persons status with at least a current Top Secret US DoD or IC clearance is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;This is a customer-facing role required to be based in Oahu. Work will likely require time in secure or classified environments and periodic travel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
