&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead mission engagements.&lt;/strong&gt; Build trusted relationships with operational, technical, and leadership stakeholders to understand mission needs, constraints, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate mission problems into plans.&lt;/strong&gt; Turn mission needs into clear problem statements, requirements, milestones, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape pilots and pathways to scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Define objectives, timelines, and adoption plans that convert early wins into sustained programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate the “why” and the “how.”&lt;/strong&gt; Create crisp technical narratives that map our agent-based capabilities to mission requirements and operational constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the operating cadence.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead weekly customer syncs, internal standups, executive updates/QBRs, action-item tracking, and risk reviews, as applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate cross-functional delivery.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Product and Engineering to ensure mission context is reflected in scope, tradeoffs, and delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate program realities.&lt;/strong&gt; Help stakeholders work through requirements development, budgeting cycles, contracting pathways, and coordination across organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate onboarding, training, and customer success so the customer can use and sustain the capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain durable account knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep high-signal documentation in Notion: stakeholders, org charts, use cases, timelines, deliverables, decisions, and lessons learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support expansion.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify adjacent use cases and partner with Account teams where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years owning outcomes in complex customer environments (defense, intelligence, public sector, or similarly regulated domains)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functionally without consistent guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication; able to synthesize ambiguity into clear plans and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to scope and articulate a solution credibly: connect mission problems to software capabilities and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sufficient technical fluency to partner effectively with Product and Engineering and translate complex concepts into mission-relevant narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational skills: planning, prioritization, stakeholder management, and follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
