&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable operational success.&lt;/strong&gt; Support onboarding, training, workflow integration, and change management efforts to ensure users can effectively employ and sustain the capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain mission awareness.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain deep knowledge of customer organizations, operational priorities, stakeholders, mission sets, and evolving cyber challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support growth and expansion.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify adjacent mission opportunities, emerging requirements, and pathways to broaden impact across the cyber mission enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
