&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vannevar builds AI systems for the Department of War&#39;s most consequential missions. We have 125 deployments across every branch and combatant command spanning our core platform and five distinct products. An an example of how we work, when major combat operations started with Iran, we fielded a new product supporting 24/7 operations and 9,000+ users in three months.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;How we build is our advantage: we deploy forward with the people who own the mission. Our engineers, product team, and CTO deploy forward to the point of friction, including visiting units in Ukraine. We focus on embedding directly with operational units supporting great power competition with China, combat operations with Iran, and counter-narcotics missions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a forward deployed Mission Lead to embed directly with our Department of War (DOW) customers across the United States. You’ll work as part of a mission-focused team of engineers and other mission leads to deploy software against challenging problems.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;While this role requires frequent travel, we’re committed to hiring locally and strengthening Vannevar’s presence in communities—like Tampa—that our team members already call home. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will travel onsite, sit alongside uniformed service members and civilian operators alike. Your job is to earn trust by creating value: understanding what users are trying to accomplish, decomposing ambiguous problems into specific mission hypotheses, testing those hypotheses through workflows in our products, and onboarding users when those workflows prove useful.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is not a traditional customer success, solutions, or product role.&amp;nbsp;Your role is to solve complex and&amp;nbsp;ambiguous&amp;nbsp;problems.&amp;nbsp;You will configure product workflows, test and troubleshoot new releases, triage issues, and work closely with&amp;nbsp;product and&amp;nbsp;engineering to make our products more effective&amp;nbsp;for the people using them&amp;nbsp;in the field. Some of this work will be gritty. Configurations may take hours and multiple iterations each day to get right.&amp;nbsp;Expect complex problems, murky answers, and moving targets – the payoff is work that directly shapes outcomes for our users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will partner with the Mission team to cultivate relationships with new user groups on site, generate wins with those users, and translate those wins into the stories that help Vannevar&amp;nbsp;sustain and expand deployments. You will be the face of Vannevar for many of our&amp;nbsp;users and customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will often&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;independently on site. You will have support from product, engineering, mission development, and leadership, but you will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;deciding where to focus and how to maximize mission impact.&amp;nbsp;Roles like this are how we grow outside of traditional defense hubs, investing in innovative environments across America.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Persons status with at least a current Top Secret clearance in required.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;This is a customer-facing role required to be based in Tampa, FL. Work will require time in secure or classified environments and periodic travel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
